me For Delivery!", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**\ud83d\udce6 (this game is discontinued!)**\n\nwelcome to **time for delivery**, where every server is a chance for a new adventure! jump between exciting game modes, meet new people, roleplay, dress up with tons of unique cosmetics, or just hang out in the lobby.\n\ud83c\udfad **customize your character** with a huge selection of cosmetics and faces.\n\n\ud83c\udfae **explore multiple game modes**, each offering a different experience.\n\n\ud83c\udf1f **socialize, roleplay, or just mess around** with friends and other players.\n\n\ud83c\udfe2 **discover the iconic boxazon fulfillment center...** if you're brave enough.\n\n---\n\n**\ud83d\udce2 join our discord community!**\n\nwant updates, sneak peeks, announcements, or just a place to chat with other players? we'd love to have you!\n\n**discord:** https://discord.gg/ha76XcuCgR\n\n---\n\n**so... what's your choice?**\n\n\ud83d\udce6 stay far away from the **boxazon fulfillment center**...\n\n**or**\n\n\ud83d\udcaa step inside and prove you've got what it takes to **rock the fulfillment center.**\n", "short_description": "a game where you're a package running around with cool hats and stuff"}]}, "developer_name": "juniors stupid stuff", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/juniorsstupidstuff/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "juniors stupid stuff", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/juniorsstupidstuff", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb"